<title>USA: Eagle-Picher amends reorganization plan.</title>
<headline>Eagle-Picher amends reorganization plan.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eagle-Picher Industries said on Wedensday it filed a Third Amended Consolidated Plan of Reorganization and the accompanying proposed disclosure statement in U.S. Bankruptcy Court in Cincinnati.</p>
<p>The court approved the disclosure statement, the company said.</p>
<p>Voting on the plan by the various classes of creditors must be completed by November 4.</p>
<p>The court also set a hearing to consider confirmation of the plan for November 13, the company said.</p>
</text>
